            <div xml:id="d601">

                <pb facs="0896" n="790" sameAs="frus:frus1933-39/pg790"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.014/203: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Steinhardt</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-11-02T16:00:00+03:00">November 2, 1939—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 2—1:20 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>850. The Supreme Soviet at its evening session yesterday acceded to the petition
                    of the National Assembly of Western Ukraine to incorporate that territory into
                    the Soviet Union as a part of the Ukrainian Soviet Socialist Republic. According
                    to the agenda, Western White Russia will be incorporated this evening.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Steinhardt</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
